# Urban Retreat: "{2}, Return a tapped creature you control to its owner's hand: Put this card from your hand onto the
# battlefield. Activate only as a sorcery." Bot1 casts an Ornithopter and two Moxen on turn 1. With the Ornithopter untapped
# the ability cannot be activated (refused). On turn 3 the Ornithopter attacks and is tapped; while attackers are declared,
# with the Moxen untapped and the creature tapped, the ability is still refused (sorcery speed: not a main phase). In the
# second main phase Bot1 pays {2} and returns it to hand, and the land enters tapped ("This land enters tapped"), without
# using the turn's land play (Bot1 plays a Plains too).

